        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion PH-D9, Ornate Floral Trim Toilet Paper Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion hardware is known for their attention to detail and their high quality products, and the Oval Floral Mount Toilet Paper Holder is no exception to their standards. This toilet tissue holder--part of Fusion's Bella Villa Collection--is available in 6 lovely finishes. It is easy to install and comes packaged with the mounting hardware. The ornateness of this bathroom accessory is sure to catch eyes. It will add glamour to any bathroom.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-floral-towel-bar-fusion-tb-d9\"><b>Fusion TB-D9 Oval Floral Mount Towel Bar</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-floral-mount-hand-towel-ring-fusion-tr-d9\"><b>Fusion TR-D9 Oval Floral Mount Towel Ring</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-floral-mount-robe-hook-fusion-rh-d9\"><b>Fusion RH-D9 Oval Floral Mount Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Fusion Bella Villa Wall Mounted Toilet Tissue Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Reversible to hang in either direction.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
